duello metteranno in gioco l'orgoglio e tutte le esperienze passate."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Yu-Gi-Oh!: The Dark Side of Dimensions","overview":"Having faced each other on countless occasions, Yugi and Kaiba again put their pride and experience to the test in a duel that transcends dimensions.","tagline":"Back to the stage of battle."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"千年パズルを完成させたことにより、≪闇遊戯≫という、もう１人の人格を呼び覚ました武藤遊戯。海馬コーポレーションの社長にして決闘者(デュエリスト)の頂点に君臨する海馬瀬人や、仲間たちと数々の死闘を繰り広げたが、過去との因縁により、もう1人の自分との闘いを余儀なくされ、遊戯と闇遊戯はついに決別し、別々の道へ旅立つこととなった--。そうして、闇遊戯との最後の決闘を終えて、日常を取り戻したかに見えた遊戯たち。その前に現れた謎の少年≪藍神(あいがみ)≫。そして、世界中で次々と起こる謎の失踪事件。ただひたすら千年パズルを探し求める海馬。すべてのピースが合わさるとき、再び決闘（デュエル）の幕が切って落とされる！","tagline":"新たな未来を拓くのは　意志か、絆か、理想か――――。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vx9nngctwY0OX0HF89DFSSA7pOj.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vx9nngctwY0OX0HF89DFSSA7pOj.png","language":"en","width":1263,"height":538}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fLxIlQwDwzxdBUD8mmkMeYu5c7b.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fLxIlQwDwzxdBUD8mmkMeYu5c7b.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/37dOFHvRN8Fgfap76C6ChxzhbYs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/37dOFHvRN8Fgfap76C6ChxzhbYs.jpg","language":"it","width":850,"height":1191},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ti0CRprP9iSg9IDadTZ3TFnuczS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ti0CRprP9iSg9IDadTZ3TFnuczS.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nFQkn1KE0Is3FUW0yPPgdVvCnlo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nFQkn1KE0Is3FUW0yPPgdVvCnlo.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j5itNPXLzwr4Jd80sMHCx36mIyj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j5itNPXLzwr4Jd80sMHCx36mIyj.jpg",